+/**
+ * The hand-mapped cliffs of a demo site (plan 15b; docs/cliffs-data.md), on the scenario's 10 m ground, for the 3-D view. Display data only,
+ * like the aerial photo next to it (imagery.ts): it goes to `SceneView.setScenario` and never into the scenario the engine is given
+ * (plan section 4, rule 10). No site has such a file today: the bundled-data manifest says so, and then nothing is requested or loaded.
