Subject: [PATCH 05/10] Hand-mapped cliffs: fetch the look only on rock, drop
 the map once the view has drawn from it, and a real-view e2e

The style and profile texel is read inside the branch only rock takes, so bare ground pays nothing for it; the sim screen does not keep the map's four
bytes a cell for the whole run. The cliffs spec gains one test: a map over Katoomba's face changes that face's pixels (dark style, a rock share of 0, the
vertical profile) and no pixel outside its box.

